<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile rejects MC ferro-manganese offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile rejects MC ferro-manganese offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it rejected all offers for medium carbon ferro-manganese.</p>
<p>Stockpile reiterated that all restrictions on sale of ferro-manganese only apply to high carbon material. There are no restrictions on the sale of medium carbon grade.</p>
<p>The next bid opening for medium carbon ferro-manganese is April 22.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
